        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba wakaswiilila impuwo ya-Solomoni ayazina lya-Jehova, nkabela wakeza kukumusunka atulabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waka­ sika ku-Jerusalemu ampumba impati loko, ankamele ziyumwide zilisyo angolida zinji loko amabwe mayandisi, elyo naakasika kuli-Solomoni, wakamwaambila makani oonse aakali mumoyo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tus 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.50.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 50:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Solomoni wakamupandulwida mibuzyo yakwe yoonse. Katakwe cintu niciba comwe icakasisidwe kumwami ancakakacilwa kumupandulwida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino oyo mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba, naakamana kubona busongo boonse bwa-Solomoni, aŋanda njaakayakide, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.26.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mak 26:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "azilyo zyakuntafule yakwe, akukala kwabalanda bakwe, akukutauka kwabazike bakwe, azyakusama zyabo, abajiki bakwe, azituuzyo nzyaakali kutuula muŋanda ya-Jehova, moyo wakwe wakaata loko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
