              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakaambila mwami kuti, Impuwo yamakani aako ayabusongo bwako, njindakamvwa mucisi cangu, yakali yakusinizya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele teendakazuminina majwi ngendakamvwa, mane ndasika akubona ameso aangu ndemwini. Lino ncobeni teendakaambilwa cisela, nkaambo busongo bwako abubotu bwako mbupati akwiinda impuwo njindakamvwide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
