              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwami Solomoni wakapa mwami mwanakazi waku-Seba kufumbwa moyo wakwe nciwakayanda, ncaakakumbila, kutaamba zintu ezyo nzyaakapegwa buyo kumaanza aamwami Solomoni. Elyo wakapiluka, wakaya kunyika yakwe, walo abalanda bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
