        {
          "text": "Lino bulemu bwangolida iyakatambulwa mumaanza aa-Solomoni mumwaka omwe bwakali matalenta aangolida aali myanda iili musanu aumwi amakumi aali musanu alimwi amusanu alimwi, ",
