              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bami boonse baansi bakali kuyandaula kubona busyu bwa-Solomoni, kuti baswiilile busongo bwakwe Leza mbwaakabikide mumoyo wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
