        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Solomoni wakalivuzizya inkalaki abasimbizi. Kajisi inkalaki zili cuulu amyanda yone, abasimbizi bali zyuulu zili ikumi azibili mbaakabika muminzi yankalaki amu-Jerusalemu mwami mwaakabede. ",
          "type": "text",
