        {
          "text": "Inkalaki yakaulwa ku-Egepita mali aansiliva aali myanda iili musanu aumwi, abbiza lyakaulwa mali aali mwanda amakumi osanwe. Aboobo zyakatolwa kumaanza aabasambazi bamwami kubami boonse baba-Hiti ababa-Aramu.",
